      "text": "where the global parameter τ˙ in the denominator emerges to compensate the change of measure in the action induced by the transformation t → τ, and both ρ and ξ in this expression must be thought of as functions of the parameter τ. In general, the new time variable τ(t) may be considered as a nonlinear function in t. In particular, we can redeﬁne the time variable τ(t) such that",
